flowchart TB
  subgraph S[Systemic Design Method — solve the bounded problem]
    direction LR
    A[01 Observe\nperson · workflow · signal] --> B[02 Frame\nproblem · constraints · promise]
    B --> C[03 Build\ndata · model · interface · handoff]
    C --> D[04 Validate\nusefulness · reliability · comprehension]
    D -.learning.-> A
  end

  subgraph I[Four-Stage Innovation Method — carry evidence into action]
    direction LR
    E[01 Sense\nclinic artifacts + outcomes] --> F[02 Reason\npolicy · inference · evidence]
    F --> G[03 Deploy\nproduct + FDE workflow]
    G --> H[04 Improve\noutcomes + human-gated feedback]
    H -.continuous loop.-> E
  end

  A -.grounds.-> E
  B -.structures.-> F
  C -.operationalizes.-> G
  D -.governs.-> H

